WEBVTT - Class 1 English Mridang Chapter 7: The Food We Eat

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:45.000
<v Teacher Tara>Look at Ananya's thali! It looks like a bright rainbow: green spinach dal, orange crunchy carrots, golden rotis, and white curd.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:01:30.000
<v Teacher Tara>Natural food gives our brain the power to think and our legs the energy to run! Fresh fruits and vegetables keep us feeling fantastic.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:02:15.000
<v Teacher Tara>Wash your hands clean with soap first. Sit down with family, chew your food calmly, and enjoy every bite without staring at mobile screens.

00:02:15.000 --> 00:03:00.000
<v Teacher Tara>Farmers worked under the sun to grow this grain. We never waste food on our plate. We say thank you with an open, grateful heart!

